{title: Magar Aaya Na Tu}
{artist: Arjun Kanungo Momina Mustehsan}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Tum kabhi na [D]kahoge,        Kyun na [A]hum hi ye bol [Bm]de
[Bm]Ho kahan yeh [D]bataao,        Hum [A]wahan chal ke aa jaye [Bm]nge
Bheege bheege [D]mausam khile the [Em]jahaan,        Tere mere [Bm]raste mile the [Em]jahaan
Baahon mein [Bm]teri din dhale the [Em]jahaan,        Aa gaya [Bm]main [A]wo [Em]
Magar [Em]aaya na tu,        [A]Aaya na tu
[Em]Aaya na tu,        Magar [Em]aaya na tu
[A]Aaya na tu,        [Em]Aaya na tu
Baithe baithe [Bm]sochu kabhi main [Em]tujhe,        Aankhon ko [D]meri tu kahin na [Em]dikhe
Aise mein [G]main aawaz [D]doon toh [Em]kise,        Hoon yahin [D]main [A]wo [Em]
Magar [Em]aaya na tu,        [A]Aaya na tu
[Em]Aaya na tu,        Magar [Em]aaya na tu
[A]Aaya na tu,        [Em]Aaya na tu
Socha tha a [Bm]gar main milungi [A]tujhe,        Mere dil ki [D]baatein [Bm]kahungi [Em]tujhe
Shayad tu [Bm]badi door hai ja [A]chuka,        Main akeli [D]reh [Em]gayi
Na jaane tu [A]kahan kho [Bm]gaya,        Jaate jaate [Bm]tu mud ke phir dekh [Em]le
Dil kehta hai [D]phir ek dafa dhoondh [Em]le,        Aayegi kabhi [Bm]woh yahin laut [Em]ke
Hoon yahin [D]main [A]wo [Em],        Magar [Em]aaya na tu
[A]Aaya na tu,        [Em]Aaya na tu
Magar [Em]aaya na tu,        [A]Aaya na tu
[Em]Aaya na tu
